# Generated by scripts/probe-hamburger.cjs
scripts/ham-probe/

# Review screenshots produced by the scripts/*.cjs capture helpers (shoot-*,
# measure-*, cmp-*). They are throwaway artifacts — a full-page mobile capture
# of /shop is ~18MB, and every regeneration added that again, permanently, to
# the history: 147MB across 128 files before this rule. Nothing reads them at
# build or run time, and no script takes one as input, so they only ever need
# to exist on the machine that captured them. Site assets are NOT covered by
# this: those live in public/ and src/assets/ and stay versioned.
scripts/**/*.png
